    "summary": "Errata rewriting Creeping Barrage, part of the [Artillery Support](vsdata:ability/astra-militarum.siege-regiment.artillery-support) rule of the Siege Regiment detachment. Roll a D6 per enemy unit that is over 12\" away from all your models on the battlefield; each 5+ makes that unit shaken for the rest of the battle round. A shaken unit gets:\n\n- -2\" to its Move characteristic\n- -2 to its **Charge rolls**\n\nThe cap on units this rule can make shaken in a battle round is set by battle size:\n\n- Incursion: 2\n- Strike Force: 3\n- Onslaught: 4",
